<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Background in networked MARL</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we provide background on networked MARL, beginning with the definition of the exponential decay property introduced in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib19" title="" class="ltx_ref">19</a>]</cite>.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmdefinition3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_definition">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmdefinition3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition 3</span></span><span id="Thmdefinition3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Exponential decay property)<span id="Thmdefinition3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmdefinition3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmdefinition3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The <math id="Thmdefinition3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(c,\rho)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(c,\rho)</annotation></semantics></math>-exponential decay property holds if, for any localized policy <math id="Thmdefinition3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math>, for any <math id="Thmdefinition3.p1.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="i\in\mathscr{N},\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\in\mathcal{S}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}}^{\prime}\in\mathcal{S}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\in\mathcal{A}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}}^{\prime}\in\mathcal{A}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},Q_{i}^{\pi}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathscript">𝒩</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐬</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐬</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐬</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>Q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>π</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\mathscr{N},\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\in\mathcal{S}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}}^{\prime}\in\mathcal{S}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\in\mathcal{A}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}}^{\prime}\in\mathcal{A}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},Q_{i}^{\pi}</annotation></semantics></math> satisfies,</p>
<table id="A3.Ex14" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left|Q_{i}^{\pi}\left(\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}^{\kappa}_{-i}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}^{\kappa}_{-i}}\right)-Q_{i}^{\pi}\left(\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}}^{\prime},a_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}}^{\prime}\right)\right|\leq c\rho^{\kappa+1}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐬</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left|Q_{i}^{\pi}\left(\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}^{\kappa}_{-i}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}^{\kappa}_{-i}}\right)-Q_{i}^{\pi}\left(\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}}^{\prime},a_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}}^{\prime}\right)\right|\leq c\rho^{\kappa+1}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Furthermore, <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib20" title="" class="ltx_ref">20</a>]</cite> proves that the exponential decay property holds generally with <math id="A3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho=\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho=\gamma</annotation></semantics></math> for discounted MDPs.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 1</span></span><span id="Thmlemma1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Assume <math id="Thmlemma1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\forall i,r_{i}\leq\bar{r}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\forall i,r_{i}\leq\bar{r}</annotation></semantics></math>. Then the <math id="Thmlemma1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left(\frac{\bar{r}}{1-\gamma},\gamma\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left(\frac{\bar{r}}{1-\gamma},\gamma\right)</annotation></semantics></math>-exponential decay property holds.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">The exponential decay property implies that the dependence of <math id="A3.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{i}^{\pi}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>π</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{i}^{\pi}</annotation></semantics></math> on other agents shrinks quickly as the distance grows, which motivates the truncated <math id="A3.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math>-functions <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib20" title="" class="ltx_ref">20</a>]</cite>,</p>
<table id="A3.Ex15" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{Q}_{i}^{\pi}\left(\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\right):=\sum_{\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}}\in\mathcal{S}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}}\in\mathcal{A}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}}}w_{i}\left(\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}};\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\right)Q_{i}^{\pi}\left(s_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}}\right)," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">:=</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub></mrow></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{Q}_{i}^{\pi}\left(\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\right):=\sum_{\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}}\in\mathcal{S}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}}\in\mathcal{A}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}}}w_{i}\left(\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}};\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\right)Q_{i}^{\pi}\left(s_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}}\right),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p3.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A3.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{i}\left(\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}};\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{i}\left(\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}};\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math> are any non-negative weights satisfying</p>
<table id="A3.Ex16" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}}\in\mathcal{S}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}}\in\mathcal{A}_{\mathcal{N}^{\kappa}_{-i}}}w_{i}\left(\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}};\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\right)=1,\quad\forall\left(\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\right)\in\mathcal{S}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\times\mathcal{A}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub></mrow></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>∀</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}}\in\mathcal{S}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}}\in\mathcal{A}_{\mathcal{N}^{\kappa}_{-i}}}w_{i}\left(\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{-i}};\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\right)=1,\quad\forall\left(\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\right)\in\mathcal{S}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\times\mathcal{A}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p3.3" class="ltx_p">With the definition of the truncated <math id="A3.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math>-function, when the exponential decay property holds, the truncated <math id="A3.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math>-function approximates the full <math id="A3.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math>-function with high accuracy and can be used to approximate the policy gradient.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 2</span></span><span id="Thmlemma2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Under the <math id="Thmlemma2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(c,\rho)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(c,\rho)</annotation></semantics></math>-exponential decay property, the following holds:
(a) Any truncated <math id="Thmlemma2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math>-function satisfies,</p>
<table id="A3.Ex17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sup_{(\mathbf{s},\mathbf{a})\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}}\left|\hat{Q}_{i}^{\pi}\left(\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\right)-Q_{i}^{\pi}(\mathbf{s},\mathbf{a})\right|\leq c\rho^{\kappa+1}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">sup</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐬</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi></mrow></mrow></munder><mrow><mo lspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐬</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sup_{(\mathbf{s},\mathbf{a})\in\mathcal{S}\times\mathcal{A}}\left|\hat{Q}_{i}^{\pi}\left(\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\right)-Q_{i}^{\pi}(\mathbf{s},\mathbf{a})\right|\leq c\rho^{\kappa+1}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmlemma2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">(b) Given <math id="Thmlemma2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>, define the following truncated policy gradient,</p>
<table id="A3.Ex18" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex18.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\hat{h}_{i}(\theta)=\frac{1}{1-\gamma}\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{s}\sim\rho^{\theta},\mathbf{a}\sim\pi^{\theta}(\cdot\mid\mathbf{s})}\left[\frac{1}{n}\nabla_{\theta_{i}}\log\pi_{i}^{\theta_{i}}\left(\mathbf{a}_{i}\mid\mathbf{s}_{i}\right)\sum_{j\in\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\hat{Q}_{j}^{\pi}\left(\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{j}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{j}^{\kappa}}\right)\right]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>h</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>𝐬</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>ρ</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>𝐬</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mi>log</mi><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></mrow></munder><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>Q</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{h}_{i}(\theta)=\frac{1}{1-\gamma}\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{s}\sim\rho^{\theta},\mathbf{a}\sim\pi^{\theta}(\cdot\mid\mathbf{s})}\left[\frac{1}{n}\nabla_{\theta_{i}}\log\pi_{i}^{\theta_{i}}\left(\mathbf{a}_{i}\mid\mathbf{s}_{i}\right)\sum_{j\in\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}\hat{Q}_{j}^{\pi}\left(\mathbf{s}_{\mathcal{N}_{j}^{\kappa}},\mathbf{a}_{\mathcal{N}_{j}^{\kappa}}\right)\right].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmlemma2.p1.3" class="ltx_p">Then, if <math id="Thmlemma2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|\nabla_{\theta_{i}}\log\pi_{i}^{\theta_{i}}\left(\mathbf{a}_{i}\mid\mathbf{s}_{i}\right)\right\|\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|\nabla_{\theta_{i}}\log\pi_{i}^{\theta_{i}}\left(\mathbf{a}_{i}\mid\mathbf{s}_{i}\right)\right\|\leq</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="Thmlemma2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{i},\forall\mathbf{a}_{i},\mathbf{s}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐬</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{i},\forall\mathbf{a}_{i},\mathbf{s}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have <math id="Thmlemma2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|\hat{h}_{i}(\theta)-\nabla_{\theta_{i}}J(\theta)\right\|\leq\frac{cL_{i}}{1-\gamma}\rho^{\kappa+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>h</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mi>J</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|\hat{h}_{i}(\theta)-\nabla_{\theta_{i}}J(\theta)\right\|\leq\frac{cL_{i}}{1-\gamma}\rho^{\kappa+1}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma2" title="Lemma 2. ‣ Appendix C Background in networked MARL ‣ Causality Meets Locality: Provably Generalizable and Scalable Policy Learning for Networked Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> shows that the truncated <math id="A3.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math>-function has a much smaller dimension than the true <math id="A3.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math>-function, and is thus scalable to compute and store. However, despite the reduction in dimension, the error resulting from the approximation is small.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Algorithm design</h2>

<section id="A4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.1 </span>Roadmap and pipeline</h3>

<div id="A4.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A4.F3" title="Figure 3 ‣ D.1 Roadmap and pipeline ‣ Appendix D Algorithm design ‣ Causality Meets Locality: Provably Generalizable and Scalable Policy Learning for Networked Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> visually illustrates the GSAC pipeline, complementing the roadmap. It complements Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ 4.3 Key idea: meta-learning via actor-critic optimization ‣ 4 Generalizable and scalable actor-critic ‣ Causality Meets Locality: Provably Generalizable and Scalable Policy Learning for Networked Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> by showing how causal recovery and ACR construction (Phases 1–2) compress the state-action space, enabling efficient meta-policy training (Phase 3), and how this meta-policy rapidly adapts to new domains (Phase 4), as guaranteed by Theorems <a href="#Thmtheorem2" title="Theorem 2 (Critic error bound, informal). ‣ Critic error bound. ‣ 6.1 Convergence ‣ 6 Convergence results and adaptation gap ‣ Causality Meets Locality: Provably Generalizable and Scalable Policy Learning for Networked Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>-<a href="#Thmtheorem4" title="Theorem 4 (Adaptation guarantee). ‣ 6.2 Generalization ‣ 6 Convergence results and adaptation gap ‣ Causality Meets Locality: Provably Generalizable and Scalable Policy Learning for Networked Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.F3" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.F3.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="313.65" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 459.21 313.65" width="459.21"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" stroke="#000000" transform="translate(0,313.65) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(103.62,0) translate(0,219.82)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" stroke-width="1.2pt"><path d="M 97.26 50.2 L -97.26 50.2 C -100.31 50.2 -102.79 47.72 -102.79 44.66 L -102.79 -44.66 C -102.79 -47.72 -100.31 -50.2 -97.26 -50.2 L 97.26 -50.2 C 100.31 -50.2 102.79 -47.72 102.79 -44.66 L 102.79 44.66 C 102.79 47.72 100.31 50.2 97.26 50.2 Z M -102.79 -50.2"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="1.2pt" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -94.49 20.58)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:14.77em;--ltx-fo-height:0.63em;--ltx-fo-depth:3.6em;font-size:10pt;" height="58.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="204.38"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.F3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:14.77em;">
<span id="A4.F3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"></span>
<span id="A4.F3.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.F3.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Phase 1: Causal &amp; Domain
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:-2.0pt;"><span id="A4.F3.pic1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
• Recover local causal masks <math id="A4.F3.pic1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="c_{\cdot\to\cdot}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em" stretchy="false">→</mo><mo lspace="0em">⋅</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{\cdot\to\cdot}</annotation></semantics></math>
<br class="ltx_break">• Estimate latent domain factors <math id="A4.F3.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\omega" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ω</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2"><path d="M 100.02 50.2 L 5.46 50.2 C 3.94 50.2 2.7 48.96 2.7 47.43 L 2.7 37.59 C 2.7 36.06 3.94 34.82 5.46 34.82 L 100.02 34.82 C 101.55 34.82 102.79 36.06 102.79 37.59 L 102.79 47.43 C 102.79 48.96 101.55 50.2 100.02 50.2 Z M 2.7 34.82"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 5.46 39.74)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:8em;--ltx-fo-height:0.65em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.18em;font-size:8.5pt;" height="9.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 7.69)" width="94.11"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A4.F3.pic1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Thm. 1; Prop. 4–5</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" stroke-width="1.2pt"><path d="M 329.54 50.2 L 142.9 50.2 C 139.85 50.2 137.37 47.72 137.37 44.66 L 137.37 -44.66 C 137.37 -47.72 139.85 -50.2 142.9 -50.2 L 329.54 -50.2 C 332.6 -50.2 335.07 -47.72 335.07 -44.66 L 335.07 44.66 C 335.07 47.72 332.6 50.2 329.54 50.2 Z M 137.37 -50.2"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="1.2pt" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 145.67 30.13)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:14.15em;--ltx-fo-height:0.63em;--ltx-fo-depth:4.98em;font-size:10pt;" height="77.56" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="195.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.F3.pic1.3" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:14.15em;">
