<span id="A4.F3.pic1.3.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.F3.pic1.3.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Phase 2: ACR Construction
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:-2.0pt;"><span id="A4.F3.pic1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
• Value ACR <math id="A4.F3.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s^{\circ}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>s</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup><mo>∘</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s^{\circ}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}</annotation></semantics></math>
<br class="ltx_break">• Policy ACR <math id="A4.F3.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s^{\circ}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>s</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∘</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s^{\circ}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}}</annotation></semantics></math>
<br class="ltx_break">• Domain ACR <math id="A4.F3.pic1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\omega^{\circ}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>ω</mi><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>κ</mi></msubsup><mo>∘</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega^{\circ}_{\mathcal{N}_{i}^{\kappa}}</annotation></semantics></math>
<br class="ltx_break">• Exp.-decay bounded errors</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2"><path d="M 332.31 50.2 L 282.83 50.2 C 281.3 50.2 280.06 48.96 280.06 47.43 L 280.06 37.71 C 280.06 36.18 281.3 34.95 282.83 34.95 L 332.31 34.95 C 333.83 34.95 335.07 36.18 335.07 37.71 L 335.07 47.43 C 335.07 48.96 333.83 50.2 332.31 50.2 Z M 280.06 34.95"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 282.83 39.87)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:4.19em;--ltx-fo-height:0.64em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.18em;font-size:8.5pt;" height="9.72" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 7.56)" width="49.25"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A4.F3.pic1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Prop. 1–3</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" stroke-width="1.2pt"><path d="M 349.22 -71.85 L 123.22 -71.85 C 120.16 -71.85 117.68 -74.32 117.68 -77.38 L 117.68 -174.59 C 117.68 -177.64 120.16 -180.12 123.22 -180.12 L 349.22 -180.12 C 352.28 -180.12 354.76 -177.64 354.76 -174.59 L 354.76 -77.38 C 354.76 -74.32 352.28 -71.85 349.22 -71.85 Z M 117.68 -180.12"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="1.2pt" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 125.98 -88.8)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:17.22em;--ltx-fo-height:0.63em;--ltx-fo-depth:6em;font-size:10pt;" height="91.67" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="238.28"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.F3.pic1.5" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:17.22em;">
<span id="A4.F3.pic1.5.1" class="ltx_p"></span>
<span id="A4.F3.pic1.5.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.F3.pic1.5.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Phase 3: Meta Actor–Critic
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:-2.0pt;"><span id="A4.F3.pic1.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
• Train on <math id="A4.F3.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math> source domains with ACR inputs
<br class="ltx_break">• Critic: TD on <math id="A4.F3.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q(s^{\circ},a^{\kappa},\omega^{\circ})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>κ</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>ω</mi><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q(s^{\circ},a^{\kappa},\omega^{\circ})</annotation></semantics></math>
<br class="ltx_break">• Actor: localized PG using <math id="A4.F3.pic1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>κ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa</annotation></semantics></math>-hop returns</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2"><path d="M 351.99 -71.85 L 302.68 -71.85 C 301.15 -71.85 299.91 -73.09 299.91 -74.61 L 299.91 -82.3 C 299.91 -83.83 301.15 -85.07 302.68 -85.07 L 351.99 -85.07 C 353.52 -85.07 354.76 -83.83 354.76 -82.3 L 354.76 -74.61 C 354.76 -73.09 353.52 -71.85 351.99 -71.85 Z M 299.91 -85.07"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 302.68 -82.3)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:4.17em;--ltx-fo-height:0.65em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:8.5pt;" height="7.69" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 7.69)" width="49.08"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A4.F3.pic1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Thm. 2–3</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" stroke-width="1.2pt"><path d="M 83.48 -75.79 L -83.48 -75.79 C -86.53 -75.79 -89.01 -78.27 -89.01 -81.32 L -89.01 -170.65 C -89.01 -173.7 -86.53 -176.18 -83.48 -176.18 L 83.48 -176.18 C 86.53 -176.18 89.01 -173.7 89.01 -170.65 L 89.01 -81.32 C 89.01 -78.27 86.53 -75.79 83.48 -75.79 Z M -89.01 -176.18"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="1.2pt" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -80.71 -112.06)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:12.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.63em;--ltx-fo-depth:2.64em;font-size:10pt;" height="45.14" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="174.63"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.F3.pic1.7" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:12.62em;">
<span id="A4.F3.pic1.7.1" class="ltx_p"></span>
<span id="A4.F3.pic1.7.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.F3.pic1.7.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Phase 4: Fast Adaptation
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:-2.0pt;"><span id="A4.F3.pic1.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
• Few-shot estimate <math id="A4.F3.pic1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\omega}_{M+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ω</mi><mo mathsize="1.110em">^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\omega}_{M+1}</annotation></semantics></math>
<br class="ltx_break">• Deploy <math id="A4.F3.pic1.m10" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\pi_{\theta^{*}}(\cdot\,|\,s^{\circ},\hat{\omega}^{\circ}_{M+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ω</mi><mo mathsize="1.110em">^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{\theta^{*}}(\cdot\,|\,s^{\circ},\hat{\omega}^{\circ}_{M+1})</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2"><path d="M 86.24 -75.79 L 48.35 -75.79 C 46.82 -75.79 45.58 -77.03 45.58 -78.55 L 45.58 -86.24 C 45.58 -87.77 46.82 -89.01 48.35 -89.01 L 86.24 -89.01 C 87.77 -89.01 89.01 -87.77 89.01 -86.24 L 89.01 -78.55 C 89.01 -77.03 87.77 -75.79 86.24 -75.79 Z M 45.58 -89.01"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 48.35 -86.24)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:3.2em;--ltx-fo-height:0.65em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:8.5pt;" height="7.69" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 7.69)" width="37.67"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A4.F3.pic1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Thm. 4</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g stroke-width="1.2pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 104.17 0 L 125.19 0"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linejoin="miter" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 125.19 0)"><path d="M 7.47 0 C 6.55 0.23 2.52 1.51 0 2.91 L 0 -2.91 C 2.52 -1.51 6.55 -0.23 7.47 0 Z"></path></g></g><g stroke-width="1.2pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 236.22 -51.58 L 236.22 -59.67"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linejoin="miter" transform="matrix(0.0 -1.0 1.0 0.0 236.22 -59.67)"><path d="M 7.47 0 C 6.55 0.23 2.52 1.51 0 2.91 L 0 -2.91 C 2.52 -1.51 6.55 -0.23 7.47 0 Z"></path></g></g><g stroke-width="1.2pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 116.3 -125.98 L 101.19 -125.98"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linejoin="miter" transform="matrix(-1.0 0.0 0.0 -1.0 101.19 -125.98)"><path d="M 7.47 0 C 6.55 0.23 2.52 1.51 0 2.91 L 0 -2.91 C 2.52 -1.51 6.55 -0.23 7.47 0 Z"></path></g></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FBFBFB;" fill="#FBFBFB"><path d="M 88.22 93.56 L -88.22 93.56 C -91.27 93.56 -93.75 91.08 -93.75 88.02 L -93.75 78.1