<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 3</span> </span> Policy <span id="alg3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ACR</span> with finite steps</figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="alg3.6" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom"><span id="alg3.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input: causal mask <math id="alg3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{c}=(\mathbf{c}_{i})_{i\in\mathscr{N}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐜</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐜</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathscript">𝒩</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{c}=(\mathbf{c}_{i})_{i\in\mathscr{N}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div>
<div id="alg3.7" class="ltx_listing ltx_listing">
<div id="alg3.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
