              <span id="alg4.l33.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each agent <math id="alg4.l33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg4.l33.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

